Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yaqui Boxdab!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So what was that thing\Nyou guys, some kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual rocket i guess\Nyeah but who do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,launched it the big five\Nthe one upside to having
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,your mind trapped in the\Nbody of a robot monkey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,is getting to hang out\Nin serenity's arms all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,day we're looking for\Ntristan remember she's so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,cute when she acts tough\Nand the best part is all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,she can think about is\Ntrying to find me I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe Serenity really likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I can exactly blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, I'm way cooler than\Nthat Romeo wannabe dude devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I just\Nheard Tristan's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it came from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stay stuck in this\NRobo-Chimp's body too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I may start chowing on bananas and bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just say that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:01:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust you one bit, ape boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're a robot spy sent by Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a monkey, not a mad dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,With the big five running around in\Ndisguise, we're not taking any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta chip some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Carver, where were we? Oh yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I had three times as many life points as\Nyou, and I was about to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.77,0:02:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll activate my\NFairy Lily's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up 2,000 of my life points to\Nboost her attack strength by 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily, attack and destroy his behemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've overlooked my\Nmonster's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes a quick recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad I'm always one step\Nahead of you, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate the magic\Ncard, Emergency Provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,By destroying my own face down card,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the Emergency Provisions magic card\Nboosts my life points by 1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, wiping\Nyou out will be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.69,0:03:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And seizing control of your\Nbody will be even simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that enormous rocket\NI launched earlier in our duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I were you, I'd keep an\Neye on its energy gauge, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so, Lecter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Seto, you've got an audience\Nto witness your destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's gonna stomp that freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem quite confident that your\Nbrother cares about you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Kaiba's up against one of the\Nbaddest deckmasters of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what that\Nmeans, don't you, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that Kaiba's trap\Ncards are totally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like dueling with half a deck\Nlector thinks he has me backed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.57,0:04:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,into a corner but that old fool\Nis in for quite a surprise my move
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,oh well it looks like\Nthere's bad weather ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,because i activate this\Nmy heavy storm magic card
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,time for my storm to blow away all\Nof your magic and trap cards lector
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means you're done\Npowering up your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:05:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As your stepfather's right-hand man, I\Nlearned to anticipate his every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly what\NI've just done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For I activate Imperial Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For a mere 700 life points per turn, this\Ncard cancels out all your magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what that means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can't use any Trap or Magic\Ncards for the duration of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about not playing with a full deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, one of the big five\Ncan hold his own in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the fun continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.93,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll add 500 life points\Nto my total with Solemn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wishes and 1,000 more with\NLife Absorbing Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll sacrifice 7000\Nto activate Imperial Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that that's taken care of,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally unleash the\Npower of my ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Satellite cannon, begin firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When you took over Kavacorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.63,0:06:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you destroyed all of\Nthe missiles that your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,stepfather and I worked so hard to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's quite fitting that I use this\Nsatellite missile to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye to your\Nface-down, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My wicked worm beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem a little\Nstunned to me, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I stop a weapon\Nthat's up there? You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Orbiting the Earth at an\Naltitude of 240 miles,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,my satellite cannon is\Nvirtually unreachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I never heard of a dual monster\Nthat can attack from outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Satellite cannon is so high\Nabove the Earth's atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That it's shielded from the\Nattack of almost every monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost. How do you know I don't\Nhave a monster in my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that can reach it lector\Ntrust me mr kyber by the time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you summon a monster with\Nthe ability to attack my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,satellite it will be too powerful\Nto destroy that's because
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it gains 1 000 attack points\Nwith each turn at last the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,mighty seto kyber is about to\Nlose everything that He has.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And it served you right\Nafter destroying your
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,own stepfather and betraying the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.49,0:07:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time you paid the price for\Nusing others to get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto and I are a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all the time. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, it's time you learned the\Nharsh truth about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to what Lector has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stopping nothing\Nto get what you want, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber, even if it means\Ndeceiving those most loyal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to you Your treachery\Nbegan When your stepfather,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozoburo Gave you ten\Nmillion dollars to test your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,business skills When you\Nincreased the cash by threatening
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,a smaller company He was\Nimpressed with your abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and your cruelty But that wasn't\Ngood enough for you, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted more
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, as Kyber Corp's board of directors,\Nwe're curious why you've called us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all very talented men, yet\Nmy father treats you like dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've come to you today with a\Nproposition that you'd be fools to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sign on to my plan, and we'll rule the\NKyber Corporation together as a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we all started buying pieces of Kyber\NCorp to try and take over the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But securing the 51 % we\Nneeded proved difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we realized that someone was\Nleaking our plan to Gozoburo Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You told us that someone was\Nyour little brother, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you betray me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how could you\Nrat me out like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell Gozoburo, I swear, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The most horrible day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By turning on your little brother, you\Nforced Mokuba to run to your stepfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozaburo, for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.73,0:09:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Gozaburo had his own agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Mokuba owned 2% of Carbacore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly what Gozaburo\Nneeded to stay in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Five and I have decided\Nto take control of Kyber Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, but nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I knew about your\Nplan to buy out Kyber Corp,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:10:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but you were only able to buy 49%,\Nand I'm afraid that leaves me with 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose, Seto, because\Nthis company is still mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for you, Five, as punishment\Nfor betraying me, you're all fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll make sure you never\Nwork in this town again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now clean out your desks and\Nget out of my sight right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think you're off the hook, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're headed back to the orphanage\Nwhere ungrateful brats like you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite! He's staying! What? How? Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm giving my 2 % of\NKaiba Corp straight to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how badly he treated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.21,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto and I are a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I never turn my back on him! You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm the new president of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozaburo was so ashamed that he ran\Naway and no one's heard from him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So your cruel plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point, Lector?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You played us like fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokobo wasn't the snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, wasn't it, Mr. Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that your stepfather likes\Npeople to think they were women,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so when he beat them they'd\Nfeel that much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So you used Mokuba as a pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You began leaking information about\Nyour plan to Gozaburo and made everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,including him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,think it was Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So your stepfather let you\Ngain 49 % of his company,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking Mokuba would give him the\N2 % he needed to stay in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But you knew better,\Ndidn't you, Mr. Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that your little\Nbrother would be loyal to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how poorly you treated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba was the only one I trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that together he and I\Ncould take our stepfather down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You used him to achieve\Nyour own selfish goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:12:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You toyed with your brother's emotions\Nand took advantage of his trust for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you destroyed the very man who\Nrescued you from that orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeta would never hurt me on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You never intended to run Kyber Corp\Nwith us as a team, like you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When you became president, you\Ntook away our responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You used me, just like you use\Neveryone, including your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is a game, and if you\Ncan't win it, then don't play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Spirit Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of winning, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit Ryu, attack his Fairy Lily now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With Sonic Flash Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can activate Lily's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By giving up 2,000 life points,\NI boost her attack strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.39,0:13:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, he should have seen that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba's gonna lose the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Mr. Calver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Spirit\NRyu's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He gains an extra 1,000 attack points\Nfor each dragon I discard from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.85,0:13:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll only lose 400 life points\Nwhile your lily destroys my monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of\Ngame you're playing, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, but with only 800 life points\Nleft, you won't be playing it much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Kaiba let him\Ndestroy that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the precious gotten to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just figured out Kaiba's strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:14:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So he meant to do that? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Behemoth, attack his fairy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough life points\Nto increase her strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I forced you to give up\N2,000 life points last move,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,so you couldn't power\Nup your fairy this move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, guys, Lector has to give up his\Nlife points to activate his best cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So he needs his life\Npoints to be high. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,First I gain 500 life points\Nthanks to Solemn Wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then another 350 thanks to Life\NAbsorbing Machines. Wait, Lector.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to pay out 700 life points if
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you want to keep Imperial Order in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to give up\Nthat much, so I'll destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba can use his\Nmagic cards again. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand Kaiba's game plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Lecter can't\Nrestore his life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,then his whole dueling\Nstrategy goes down the drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.47,0:15:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba may win this\Nduel after all! Lecter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,how did you ever think you could\Nrun Kaiba Corp if you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,even control the numbers in a\Nsimple game of Duel Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.55,0:15:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon a monster in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then command my satellite\Ncannon to attack your behemoth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I had to ruin\Nyour good mood, Mr. Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.23,0:15:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll activate my Pot of Greed card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.57,0:15:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to draw two more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll summon the\Nmonster Possessed Dark Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Soul, attack\NLecter's face-down monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Dream Sprite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking this activated\Nits special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It can redirect your attack\Nto any of my other monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch, Mr. Paiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll transfer your attack\Nto my satellite cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's master's not strong\Nenough to reach that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm untouchable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more turn, and my satellite cannon's\Nattack points will be raised to 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to wipe out your\Nremaining life points, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a life point boost from\Nmy trap card and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How come he didn't attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's charging up his cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For one final attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take down your little space cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Most monsters could never reach that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.61,0:16:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Kaiba have a monster strong\Nenough to crush that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there may be one in his deck, but\Nwho knows if he can summon it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to this next draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now behold, my ultimate creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I'll place\Nthis in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my deck master, show\Nyour special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,At a cost of 500 of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of Dragons allows me to\Nsummon any dragon from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll sacrifice both of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Mr. Kylo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's your target!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Blue-Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down his satellite cannon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what it means, Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your satellite cannon only has\Nattack points when it's about to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it has an\Nattack power of... Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.85,0:18:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That means once I attack,\Nyou lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have known\Nbetter than to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my blue eyes, finish him\Noff with white lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you won't be leaving\Ncyberspace anytime soon. Nice job,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba wasted that big five creep
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close to finally escaping from\Nthis digital dungeon. Where's Momba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never see your brother again, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba. However, I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Seto would crush that creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, how can you still\Nbe on your brother's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He betrayed you to control Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I would stand by my\Nbrother no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family, and nothing's\Ngonna separate us. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show him, family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
